  "historyNote": "# 9436, eff 3-21-09, EXPIRED: 3-21-17 New. #12139, INTERIM, eff 3-22-17, EXPIRED: 9-18-17 New. #13369, eff 4-20-22 (formerly He-C 1503.06)",
